The firmware image archives - 53131A_Firmware_v4243.zip,
53132A_Firmware_v4613.zip and 53181A_Firmware_v4243.zip - contain the
manufacturer's program EPROM images for these counters. They are not the
work of this project, this license grants no rights in them, and copyright in
them remains with its owner (Hewlett-Packard / Agilent Technologies, now
Keysight Technologies). They are included for reference by owners of these
instruments.
